@SeriesApp.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Liveness probe
GET {{SeriesApp.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{SeriesApp.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Catalog multi-search
GET {{SeriesApp.Api_HostAddress}}/api/catalog/search?query=breaking%20bad&page=1
Accept: application/json
